    "summary": "Each model dimension with a chunk call gets a gather plan (src/workflow/review-pipeline/adapters/code-review-gather.ts): obligationCall judges each key once with today's findings schema and the dimension's rules (spec chunk.judge), on all chunks' notes and its own context; a key with no notes is judged on the no-evidence statement; with zero atoms each key is judged on its context alone. reduceCall condenses a batch into one note within noteCapChars (a quarter of the limit); notesFrom reads chunk notes; partOf maps an answer to a DimensionResult part. Locations stay governed by today's per-dimension filters (t7), not by a gather validate.",
